# The build context is the repo root (npm workspace root) — which is why the
# Dockerfile sits there too, and why this file does. Docker only ever reads
# .dockerignore from the context root. The Dockerfile itself only COPYs
# specific manifests + source paths, so everything below is either
# never copied or rebuilt inside the image — excluding it keeps the context
# upload to KB-scale (it currently ships the whole repo, incl. .git).
.git
.github
.claude
docs
deploy
node_modules
**/node_modules
cli/dist
cli/dist-web
web/dist
landing/dist
**/*.md
